{
  "about": "One raw HTML fragment of an article per case, as the Markdown parser hands it over, and what may be shown of it. The Go test (kbhtml_test.go) and the preview test (web/src/features/kb/kb-html.test.ts) both run every case, so the help center and the preview cannot drift apart. iframes is the address of each player shown (nothing else is ever shown, text included); dropped is what the preview warns about, in order; titles, when given, is the title of each player.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "youtube no-cookie player",
      "html": "<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jNQXAC9IVRw\" title=\"Me at the zoo\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" allow=\"encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>",
      "iframes": [
        "https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/jNQXAC9IVRw"
      ],
      "dropped": []
    },
    {
      "name": "the editor's Insert video snippet keeps every attribute",
